# Cooking Recipe Rating System

## Project Overview
The Cooking Recipe Rating System is a web-based application that allows users to explore cooking recipes, view recipe details, and share their ratings and feedback.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Bootstrap
- MySQL

## Main Features
- User Registration and Login
- View Cooking Recipes
- Add and Manage Recipes
- Recipe Details
- Rate Recipes
- Submit Reviews and Feedback
- Chef can see their Junior Cooking Recipe and Give Feedback 
## Database
MySQL

## Project Purpose
To provide a platform where users can discover cooking recipes and share their experiences through ratings and reviews.

